const CH_MODES = [["year", "Y", "ปีจร"], ["month", "M", "เดือนจร"], ["day", "D", "วันจร"], ["yam", "Ym", "ยามจร"]];
const paneNoDet = h => h.replace(/<!--s9--><details class="s9"><summary>([\s\S]*?)<\/summary>([\s\S]*?)<\/details><!--\/s9-->/g, '<!--s9--><div class="pdt s9"><div class="pds">$1</div>$2</div><!--/s9-->')   // รอบ 99 กล่อง S9 ไม่พับ
